        <scope doc="Locates a bitmap file of the name name.xpm or name in one of&#10;thebitmap directories (see the tix_addbitmapdir command&#10;above). By using tix_getbitmap, you can avoid hard coding&#10;the pathnames of the bitmap files in your application." ilk="function" line="148" lineend="157" name="tix_getbitmap" returns="self.tk.call()" signature="tix_getbitmap(self, name)">
