    <scope doc="Representing and manipulating email headers via custom objects.&#10;This module provides an implementation of the HeaderRegistry API. The implementation is designed to flexibly follow RFC5322 rules.  Eventually HeaderRegistry will be a public API, but it isn't yet, and will probably change some before that happens." ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.email.headerregistry">
