      <scope doc="utime(path, times=None, *, ns=None, dir_fd=None, follow_symlinks=True)Set the access and modified time of path.  path may always be specified as a string. On some platforms, path may also be specified as an open file descriptor. If this functionality is unavailable, using it raises an exception.  If times is not None, it must be a tuple (atime, mtime); atime and mtime should be expressed as float seconds since the epoch. If ns is not None, it must be a tuple (atime_ns, mtime_ns); atime_ns and mtime_ns should be expressed as integer nanoseconds" ilk="function" name="utime" signature="utime(path, times=None, *, ns=None, dir_fd=None, follow_symlinks=True)Set the access and modified time of path.  path may always be specified as a string. On some platforms, path may also be specified as an open file descriptor. If this functionality is unavailable, using it raises an exception.  If times is not None, it must be a tuple (atime, mtime); atime and mtime should be expressed as float seconds since the epoch. If ns is not None, it must be a tuple (atime_ns, mtime_ns); atime_ns and mtime_ns should be expressed as integer nanoseconds" />
