    <scope doc="# This file contains a class and a main program that perform three# related (though complimentary) formatting operations on Python # programs.  When called as &quot;pindent -c&quot;, it takes a valid Python # program as input and outputs a version augmented with block-closing # comments.  When called as &quot;pindent -d&quot;, it assumes its input is a # Python program with block-closing comments and outputs a commentless # version.   When called as &quot;pindent -r&quot; it assumes its input is a # Python program with block-closing comments but with its indentation # messed up, and outputs a properly indented version." ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Tools.Scripts.pindent">
