        <scope doc="Locates an image file of the name name.xpm, name.xbm or&#10;name.ppmin one of the bitmap directories (see the&#10;addbitmapdir command above). If more than one file with the&#10;same name (but different extensions) exist, then the image&#10;type is chosen according to the depth of the X display: xbm&#10;images are chosen on monochrome displays and color images&#10;are chosen on color displays." ilk="function" line="159" lineend="171" name="tix_getimage" returns="self.tk.call()" signature="tix_getimage(self, name)">
