        <scope doc="Called by the parser to give the application a locator&#10;forlocating the origin of document events. SAX parsers are&#10;strongly encouraged (though not absolutely required) to&#10;supply a locator: if it does so, it must supply the locator&#10;to the application by invoking this method before invoking&#10;any of the other methods in the DocumentHandler interface." ilk="function" name="setDocumentLocator" signature="setDocumentLocator(self, locator)" />
