        <scope doc="parse_args(args : [string] = sys.argv[1:],values : Values = None) -&gt; (values : Values, args : [string])  Parse the command-line options found in 'args' (default: sys.argv[1:]).  Any errors result in a call to 'error()', which by default prints the usage message to stderr and calls sys.exit() with an error message.  On success returns a pair (values, args) where 'values' is an Values instance (with all your option values) and 'args' is the list of arguments left over after parsing options." ilk="function" name="parse_args" signature="parse_args(args : [string] = sys.argv[1:],values : Values = None) -&gt; (values : Values, args : [string])  Parse the command-line options found in 'args' (default: sys.argv[1:]).  Any errors result in a call to 'error()', which by default prints the usage message to stderr and calls sys.exit() with an error message.  On success returns a pair (values, args) where 'values' is an Values instance (with all your option values) and 'args' is the list of arguments left over after parsing options." />
