    <scope doc="subprocess - Subprocesses with accessible I/O streams&#10;This module allows you to spawn processes, connect to their input/output/error pipes, and obtain their return codes.  This module intends to replace several other, older modules and functions, like:  os.system os.spawn*  Information about how the subprocess module can be used to replace these modules and functions can be found below. " ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.subprocess">
