    <scope doc="Fixer that changes zip(seq0, seq1, ...) into list(zip(seq0, seq1, ...)unless there exists a 'from future_builtins import zip' statement in the top-level namespace.  We avoid the transformation if the zip() call is directly contained in iter(&lt;&gt;), list(&lt;&gt;), tuple(&lt;&gt;), sorted(&lt;&gt;), ...join(&lt;&gt;), or for V in &lt;&gt;:." ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.lib2to3.fixes.fix_zip">
