    <scope doc="Python unit testing framework, based on Erich Gamma's JUnit and Kent Beck'sSmalltalk testing framework.  This module contains the core framework classes that form the basis of specific test cases and suites (TestCase, TestSuite etc.), and also a text-based utility class for running the tests and reporting the results (TextTestRunner).  Simple usage:  import unittest" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.unittest">
