    <scope doc="A bottom-up tree matching algorithm implementation meant to speedup 2to3's matching process. After the tree patterns are reduced to their rarest linear path, a linear Aho-Corasick automaton is created. The linear automaton traverses the linear paths from the leaves to the root of the AST and returns a set of nodes for further matching. This reduces significantly the number of candidate nodes." ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.lib2to3.btm_matcher">
