      <scope doc="Super-rmdir; remove a leaf directory and all empty&#10;intermediate ones. Works like rmdir except that, if the leaf&#10;directory is successfully removed, directories corresponding&#10;to rightmost path segments will be pruned away until either&#10;the whole path is consumed or an error occurs." ilk="function" name="removedirs" signature="removedirs(path)" />
      <scope doc="Rename a file or directory. If either src_dir_fd or&#10;dst_dir_fd is not None, it should be a file descriptor open&#10;to a directory, and the respective path string (src or dst)&#10;should be relative; the path will then be relative to that&#10;directory." ilk="function" name="rename" signature="rename(src, dst, *, src_dir_fd=None, dst_dir_fd=None)" />
      <scope doc="Super-rename; create directories as necessary and delete any&#10;left empty. Works like rename, except creation of any&#10;intermediate directories needed to make the new pathname&#10;good is attempted first." ilk="function" name="renames" signature="renames(old, new)" />
      <scope doc="Rename a file or directory, overwriting the destination. If&#10;either src_dir_fd or dst_dir_fd is not None, it should be a&#10;file descriptor open to a directory, and the respective path&#10;string (src or dst) should be relative; the path will then&#10;be relative to that directory." ilk="function" name="replace" signature="replace(src, dst, *, src_dir_fd=None, dst_dir_fd=None)" />
