        <scope doc="Wait for the barrier. When the specified number of threads&#10;havestarted waiting, they are all simultaneously awoken." ilk="function" name="wait" signature="wait(self, timeout=None)" />
        <scope doc="# If we are the last thread to exit the barrier, signal any&#10;threads# waiting for the barrier to drain." ilk="function" name="_exit" signature="_exit(self)" />
        <scope doc="Create a barrier, initialised to 'parties' threads.'action'&#10;is a callable which, when supplied, will be called by one of&#10;the threads after they have all entered the barrier and just&#10;prior to releasing them all. If a 'timeout' is provided, it&#10;is uses as the default for all subsequent 'wait()' calls." ilk="function" name="__init__" signature="__init__(self, parties, action=None, timeout=None)" />
        <scope doc="# Block until the barrier is ready for us, or raise an&#10;exception# if it is broken." ilk="function" name="_enter" signature="_enter(self)" />
        <scope doc="# Wait in the barrier until we are relased. Raise an&#10;exception# if the barrier is reset or broken." ilk="function" name="_wait" signature="_wait(self, timeout)" />
