    <scope doc="This module provides socket operations and some related functions.On Unix, it supports IP (Internet Protocol) and Unix domain sockets. On other systems, it only supports IP. Functions specific for a socket are available as methods of the socket object.  Functions:  socket() -- create a new socket object socketpair() -- create a pair of new socket objects [*] fromfd() -- create a socket object from an open file descriptor [*] fromshare() -- create a socket object from data received from socket.share() [*]" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="socket">
