      <scope classrefs="object" doc="A Signature object represents the overall signature of a function.It stores a Parameter object for each parameter accepted by the function, as well as information specific to the function itself.  A Signature object has the following public attributes and methods:  * parameters : OrderedDict An ordered mapping of parameters' names to the corresponding Parameter objects (keyword-only arguments are in the same order as listed in `code.co_varnames`). * return_annotation : object" ilk="class" name="Signature">
