    <scope doc="reindent [-d][-r][-v] [ path ... ]&#10;-d (--dryrun)   Dry run.   Analyze, but don't make any changes to, files. -r (--recurse)  Recurse.   Search for all .py files in subdirectories too. -n (--nobackup) No backup. Does not make a &quot;.bak&quot; file before reindenting. -v (--verbose)  Verbose.   Print informative msgs; else no output. (--newline)  Newline.   Specify the newline character to use (CRLF, LF). Default is the same as the original file. -h (--help)     Help.      Print this usage information and exit.  Change Python (.py) files to use 4-space indents and no hard tab characters. Also trim excess spaces and tabs from ends of lines, and remove empty lines" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Tools.Scripts.reindent">
