    <scope doc="Tokenization help for Python programs.&#10;generate_tokens(readline) is a generator that breaks a stream of text into Python tokens.  It accepts a readline-like method which is called repeatedly to get the next line of input (or &quot;&quot; for EOF).  It generates 5-tuples with these members:  the token type (see token.py) the token (a string) the starting (row, column) indices of the token (a 2-tuple of ints) the ending (row, column) indices of the token (a 2-tuple of ints) the original line (string)" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.lib2to3.pgen2.tokenize">
