    <scope doc="Stuff to parse WAVE files.&#10;Usage.  Reading WAVE files: f = wave.open(file, 'r') where file is either the name of a file or an open file pointer. The open file pointer must have methods read(), seek(), and close(). When the setpos() and rewind() methods are not used, the seek() method is not  necessary.  This returns an instance of a class with the following public methods:" ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="Lib.wave">
