    <scope doc="The Python Debugger Pdb=======================  To use the debugger in its simplest form:  &gt;&gt;&gt; import pdb &gt;&gt;&gt; pdb.run('&lt;a statement&gt;')  The debugger's prompt is '(Pdb) '.  This will stop in the first function call in &lt;a statement&gt;. " ilk="blob" lang="Python3" name="pdb">
