      <scope doc="Wait until one or more file descriptors are ready for some&#10;kind of I/O. The first three arguments are sequences of file&#10;descriptors to be waited for: rlist -- wait until ready for&#10;reading wlist -- wait until ready for writing xlist -- wait&#10;for an ``exceptional condition'' If only one kind of&#10;condition is required, pass [] for the other lists." ilk="function" name="select" signature="select(rlist, wlist, xlist[, timeout]) -&gt; (rlist, wlist, xlist)" />
